 all points in its domain. To find its domain, we set the expression under the radical to be greater than or equal to zero:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2x+1\\ge 0\\,⟹\\,2x\\ge -1\\,⟹\\,x\\ge -\\frac{1}{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the domain of $f(x)$ is $[-\\frac{1}{2},\\infty )$, and the function is continuous on this interval." 13194139534363 true] [17592186284204 1000 #edb/ref 17592186284205 13194139534363 true] [17592186284204 1000 #edb/ref 17592186284206 13194139534363 true] [17592186284204 1000 #edb/ref 17592186284207 13194139534363 true] [17592186284204 1000 #edb/ref 17592186284208 13194139534363 true] [17592186284204 1000 #edb/ref 17592186284209 13194139534363 true] [17592186284204 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534363 true] [17592186284204 1041 "selection" 13194139534363 true] [17592186284204 1104 #edb/ref 17592186284206 13194139534363 true] [17592186284204 1110 #uuid "a409d73e-0475-5491-9501-58ba11de9964" 13194139534363 true] [17592186284205 1034 "(-\\frac{1}{2},\\infty )" 13194139534363 true] [17592186284205 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534363 true] [17592186284205 1111 #uuid "da51e3ef-d19b-5cf9-8c44-a976268bbbe0" 13194139534363 true] [17592186284206 1034 "[-\\frac{1}{2},\\infty )" 13194139534363 true] [17592186284206 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534363 true] [17592186284206 1111 #uuid "ad2369b9-93e6-54b2-bacf-60c3bc26fa94" 13194139534363 true] [17592186284207 1034 "(0,\\infty )" 13194139534363 true] [17592186284207 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534363 true] [17592186284207 1111 #uuid "a91d7bf9-9db9-5d2e-8427-9356994814ed" 13194139534363 true] [17592186284208 1034 "[\\frac{1}{2},\\infty )" 13194139534363 true] [17592186284208 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534363 true] [17592186284208 1111 #uuid "302c5071-5bb0-5a26-aa2d-740b369ac9ba" 13194139534363 true] [17592186284209 1034 "(-\\infty ,-\\frac{1}{2}]" 13194139534363 true] [17592186284209 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534363 true] [17592186284209 1111 #uuid "30d